sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Candidate
    participant T as Telco Gateway
    participant A as USSD Adapter
    participant R as Result Service
    C->>T: Dial USSD code
    T->>A: Start session (existing persistent link)
    A-->>T: Prompt for PIN
    T-->>C: Enter PIN
    C->>T: PIN
    T->>A: PIN
    A-->>T: Prompt for exam number
    T-->>C: Enter exam number
    C->>T: Exam number
    T->>A: Check request
    A->>R: Redeem PIN + lookup result
    R-->>A: Result + usage decision
    A-->>T: Short result message
    T-->>C: Result
